---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/5c7bd7a1-c638-430e-ab74-a29f4ae79724.png";
---

<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Barcode & ISBN"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading ISBN & Barcode Service Provider
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Every published book needs a unique identity, and at HearEst Book Studio
        we make that process seamless. We handle the full ISBN registration and
        barcode generation process on your behalf — giving your book the official
        identifiers it needs to be listed, sold, and tracked across every major
        retail and distribution channel in the world.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Our team works with authorised ISBN agencies to secure your numbers
        quickly and correctly, then produces print-ready EAN-13 barcodes sized
        and formatted precisely to each retailer's requirements. Whether you're
        self-publishing a single title or managing a growing catalogue, we ensure
        your books are properly registered and ready for global commerce.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    An ISBN is more than just a number — it is the key that unlocks your book's presence in bookstores,
    libraries, and online retailers worldwide. HearEst Book Studio takes the guesswork out of registration
    by managing every detail: selecting the right ISBN format for each edition, generating compliant
    barcodes for your back cover, and ensuring your title metadata is correctly entered into global
    databases. With our barcode and ISBN service, your book is retail-ready from the very first print run.
  </p>
</div>
